abraflexi-mailer (1.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New abraflexi-potvrzeni-prijeti-platby (MultiFlexi app "Potvrzení přijetí
    platby"): confirms a received payment - a bank record or a cash desk
    movement (DOCID, EVIDENCE=banka|pokladni-pohyb) - to the customer who paid.
    It is sent once, when the payer is known, i.e. when the record carries the
    company (the payment was paired with an invoice or with the deduction of an
    advance, or the payer was known from the start); an unknown payer, an
    outgoing or a cancelled payment is skipped without error. The confirmed
    payment is marked with the label UHRADA_POTVRZENA (created when missing, for
    the bank and the cash desk), so the next change of the record does not send
    it again; the mark is taken back when the sending fails. The mail is in the
    language of the customer and names the invoices the payment was paired with.
  * Czech translations of the confirmation texts (they were English only).

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 20:52:35 +0100

