abraflexi-mailer (1.4.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The mail follows the language of the customer: the label LANG_xx (set by
    ClientZone) of the company the document belongs to selects the locale
    (cs_CZ, en_US) and a template written in that language,
    templates/<lang>/<evidence>.ftl, before templates/<evidence>.ftl.
    Without the label, or without a translation of the language, the
    configured LOCALIZE is used.

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:35:56 +0100

abraflexi-mailer (1.4.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * abraflexi-send: ignore unresolved {VAR} placeholders (empty DOC_RECIPIENT
    must not become the recipient address); manifest uses the {VAR} syntax
    that Job::getCmdParams() substitutes
  * Compatibility with php-spojenet-abraflexi 3.7: Functions::code()/uncode()
    instead of RO::, firma relation cast to string, evidences without typDokl
    (smlouva) no longer break DocumentMailer::getAbraFlexiTemplate()
  * Never send a document without its PDF: download is verified (HTTP 200,
    %PDF signature); missing PDF or attachment leaves it "to send" with error
  * Never send or mark as sent a document without a recipient address
  * Downloads go to a private per-message temporary directory (0700),
    always cleaned up, also in DRY_RUN and on errors
  * SEND_LOCKED works (any true value); invoices are locked again afterwards
  * Yes/no settings (ADD_LOGO, ADD_QRCODE, MUTE, DRY_RUN, APP_DEBUG,
    SEND_LOCKED) parsed properly – "false" no longer means true
  * Failed documents make the run exit with code 1
  * MultiFlexi app definitions reference https://multiflexi.eu/schema/application.json

 -- Vítězslav Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0100

